From: E App (round 7, app-auth-email-otp)
Subject: "Email me a code instead" on Sign in and after Forgot password

The code sign-in page is /signin (src/app/signin/CodeSignIn.tsx, stream E; routes in server/signin/code.js, registered
by Platform patch to-platform/002). This adds one quiet link under "Forgot password?" on Sign in (it carries the typed
email and ?next=) and the same link under the forgot-password "sent" line. Copy key `code.instead` is in src/copy/en.ts
(R7). Apply with `git apply`.

